 "明日传奇第二季", "category": "美国剧", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20210624-1/4f7a5fcf75fa9d46269478f8e6e053d5.jpg", "year": "2016", "area": "美国", "actor": "尼克·扎诺,帕特里克·J·亚当斯,约翰·巴罗曼", "director": "德莫特·唐斯,爱丽丝·特劳顿", "content": "<p>《明日传奇 DC&#39;s Legends of Tomorrow》剧组宣布下季明日传奇小队要面对的由反派组成的末日军团（Legion of Doom），其中确定成员包括黑箭Malcolm Merlyn（John Barrowman饰）﹑Damien Darhk（Neal M cDonough）﹑逆闪电（Matt Letscher）及冷冻队长（Wentworth Miller）。至于正义一方也会加员，除了已确定的逐星女（Sarah Grey）﹑时侠Rex Tyler（Patrick J. Adams）﹑钢铁公民（Nick Zano）及雌狐（Maisie Richardson-Sellers）外，剧组宣布会加入黑曜石Obsidian及午夜医生Dr. Mid-Nite，目前兩角皆未有定演员。</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "第01集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/q4CBAmCX222/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第02集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/vdzkmWGXDz2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第03集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/BB8FNaj1AH2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第04集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/GLdwBEfXm92/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第05集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/5pdCKfnzax2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第06集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/jP8kd2qhvJ2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第07集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/4ZJHuUk6Xt2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第08集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/ACaYMfBLBw2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第09集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/6xvjDS2Ga02/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第10集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/chie0GJYe72/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第11集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/LMmKKP7Tdi2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第12集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/QjYEV2KN2a2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第13集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/uT1a3nFXXd2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第14集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/7zeeNsZ9A52/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第15集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/LxeH8GSPgj2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第16集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/BMsmckGN6d2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第17集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/5t4Dr8HrAF2/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_3f40a58533_part29.json"}, {"id": 120, "title": "明日传奇第一季", "category": "美国剧", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20210624-1/4f7eaa9ca24c4a20b6d867515821c6c6.jpg", "year": "2016", "area": "美国", "actor": "亚瑟·达维尔,维克多·加博,凯蒂·洛茨", "director": "德莫特·唐斯,乔·丹特,史蒂夫·希尔", "content": "<p>当单个英雄还不足时，这世界需要一支传奇队伍，穿越猎人Rip Hunter在未来看到了大危机，于是决定回到过去，从起源阻止事件；他组合了一支英雄及奸角合作的队伍，不过问题是，这支乌合之众真的能阻止危机吗？《绿箭侠 Arrow》及《闪电侠 The Flash》同时衍生的新剧，由两剧演员加入，暂定不像前两部以一角为主的模式。 Brandon Routh饰演的是原子侠﹑Victor Garber在《闪电侠》是火风暴的其中半身﹑Wentworth Miller及Dominic Purcell则是在《闪电侠》中饰演奸角冷冻队长及热浪﹑Caity Lotz原本在《绿箭侠》中饰演前代金丝雀/Sara Lance，角色已被杀，但已复活﹑Arthur Darvill将饰演穿越猎人（Rip Hunter）﹑Ciara Renée则饰演Kendra Saunders，同时也是鹰女侠（Hawkgirl）。﹑Franz Drameh加盟本剧，饰演Jay Jackson</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "第01集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/LeQfsPQqE22/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第02集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/br8H89Tz0J2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第03集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/VGmuHE5UL12/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第04集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/Xg9wCtz9162/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第05集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/Nmu1u99H7S2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第06集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/xQLXBmzht62/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第07集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/LcT69kfYuF2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第08集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/19yBTLYNFf2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第09集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/URQ4Sq5djz2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第10集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/jkhnz8GfEi2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第11集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/YmaNBSdwyh2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第12集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/2A1hbY2qEg2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第13集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/uWaNAfQg6A2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第14集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/z0mv5Te1QL2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第15集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/ihfga94tw42/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第16集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/ZzWsvD7L0d2/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_3f40a58533_part29.json"}, {"id": 10, "title": "克拉丽斯", "category": "美国剧", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20210623-1/af645a5d9b720cf9edef7e47b5bc7922.jpg", "year": "2021", "area": "美国", "actor": "瑞贝卡·布利兹,雷欧·巴奈扎,玛尼·卡朋特", "director": "道格拉斯·阿尔尼奥科斯基,克洛伊·多蒙特,温蒂·斯坦齐勒", "content": "<p>经典剧情惊悚片《沉默的羔羊》计划推出一部衍生剧。CBS预订了新剧《克拉丽丝》(Clarice)的剧本，以电影中朱迪·福斯特饰演的特工Clarice Starling为主角，讲述《沉默的羔羊》事件一年后的1993年，她回到一线去追捕连环杀手和性犯罪者，同时也游走在华盛顿高风险的政治世界。阿历克斯·库兹曼(《新木乃伊》《星际迷航：发现号》)、詹妮·吕美特(《蕾切尔的婚礼》《星际迷航：发现号》)担任该剧编剧和执行制作人。如果顺利开发，会在2020-21播出季推出。</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "第01集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/21/DAKdQxhpaw2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第02集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/21/2mbdRywVf82/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第03集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/vgfN6fUJRT2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第04集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/VxSczaHcvH2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第05集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/7avqps4Qyb2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第06集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/ReJNNtDpUk2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第07集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/7ADxZv9eSe2/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第08集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202308/22/WWZWXcTG8f2/vi